]

[{"name": "Description", "text": "The muscles of the lower limb include those that control gross motor skills, such as running and balancing. The coordinated action of these muscles is crucial in supporting body weight and maintaining balance during stance and locomotion, and higher-level gross motor skills, such as dancing and sports.

