Arterial Supply: Lumbar arteries."}, {"name": "Key Features & Anatomical Relations", "text": "The fifth lumbar vertebra (vertebra L5) is the largest of the five lumbar vertebrae of the vertebral column. It is classified as an irregular bone and includes the following bony features:

