Rajendran, M. and Selvam, U. A. (2015) 'Transseptal fibers - crosslinking convolutes: A review', Int J Contemp Dent Med Rev."}, {"name": "Function:Function", "text": "Horizontal fibers, along with the other fibers of the alveolodental ligament, are responsible for anchoring the root cement to the alveolar bone (Rajendran and Selvam, 2015)."}]

