[
  {
    "name" : "Description",
    "text" : "The anterior border of ulna is the thick margin located along the anteromedial aspect of the body of ulna. It extends inferiorly from the medial edge of the tuberosity of ulna to the ulnar styloid process.\n\nThe anterior border of ulna separates the anterior and medial surfaces of the ulna and provides an origin site for the flexor digitorum profundus muscle."
  }
