[
  {
    "name" : "Description",
    "text" : "The sacropelvic surface of ilium is the rough, irregularly shaped area of the inner aspect of the ilium. It is one of the three surfaces of the ilium, the other two being the iliac fossa and the gluteal surface of ilium, and is an area that is bounded:

