—patellar ligament;

—medial and lateral patellar retinacula; 

—patellofemoral ligaments; 

—tibial and fibular collateral ligaments; 

—oblique popliteal ligament;

—arcuate popliteal ligament; 

—anterolateral ligament of the knee; 

