[
  {
    "name" : "Description",
    "text" : "The trapezium articular facet is the convex, laterally located area on the distal aspect of the scaphoid bone. It is continuous medially with the trapezoid articular facet. It articulates with the scaphoid articular facet of the trapezium bone, forming the scaphotrapezium joint."
