The psoas major muscle is located:

- anterior to the capsule of the hip joint, the quadratus lumborum muscle, and the iliopectineal bursa;

- posterior to the ureter and inguinal ligament;

- medial to the kidney, the iliacus muscle, and the femoral nerve;

- lateral to the lumbar vertebrae and the psoas minor and pectineus muscles.

