    "text" : "The coronoid process of ulna is the broad, anterior eminence on the proximal part of ulna. The superior aspect of the coronoid process contains the distal portion of the trochlear notch, its lateral aspect contains the radial notch, and its medial aspect contains the sublime tubercle.

The coronoid process provides:

