[
  {
    "name" : "Description",
    "text" : "The palmar surface is the rough, non-articular, anterior aspect of the scaphoid bone. It contains the tubercle of scaphoid and provides an origin site for the abductor pollicis brevis muscle. It also provides attachment sites for the:

