    "text" : "Lymph from the proximal portion of the anal canal drains via pararectal and sacral lymph nodes into the external and internal iliac lymph nodes. The distal anal canal and external anal sphincter drains via the superficial inguinal lymph nodes (Földi et al., 2012)."
